%% UC-07 — Request personalised recommendations (full M3 pipeline)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (recommendRouter)
    participant AI as API-service (FastAPI)
    participant R as Redis
    participant N as Neo4j
    participant MB as Backend (service token)
    participant LR as LightRAG
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Enter health goal
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/recommend/generate {goal, session_id}
    B->>AI: POST /api/v1/llm/recommend {user_id, goal, session_id}
    Note over B,AI: X-Service-Auth-Token header (verify_service_token)
    AI->>R: GET recommend:{sha256(user_id‖goal)}

    alt cache hit
        R-->>AI: cached RecommendResponse JSON
    else cache miss

        par M3.1 — extract-habits + annotated-habits + M3.2 all run in parallel
            Note over AI,N: Embed goal once via Qwen3-Embedding-4B (2560-dim) — reused for all searches
            AI->>N: Cypher (1 session, limit 200 rows):<br/>MATCH (h:Habit {userID: $user_id, is_habit: true})<br/>OPTIONAL MATCH (h)-[:HAS_CONTEXT]->(c:Context)<br/>RETURN h.uuid, coalesce(h.translationEN, h.sentence),<br/>       collect({dimension: c.dimension, text: c.text}), h.embedding
            N-->>AI: habit nodes with stored 2560-dim embedding vectors
            Note over AI: cosine-rank in Python → top USER_HABITS_LIMIT (default 10) personal habits

            par 3-index community fan-out (3 separate Neo4j sessions, asyncio.gather)
                AI->>N: CALL db.index.vector.queryNodes('habit_embedding_idx', $limit, $emb)<br/>YIELD node, score<br/>WHERE node.userID <> $exclude_user_id AND node.is_habit = true<br/>OPTIONAL MATCH (node)-[:HAS_CONTEXT]->(c:Context)<br/>RETURN node.uuid, sentence, collect(c), node.annotations_like, score
            and
                AI->>N: CALL db.index.vector.queryNodes('context_embedding_idx', $limit, $emb)<br/>YIELD node, score<br/>MATCH (h:Habit)-[:HAS_CONTEXT]->(node)<br/>WHERE h.userID <> $exclude_user_id AND h.is_habit = true<br/>RETURN h.uuid, sentence, collect(c), h.annotations_like, score
            and
                AI->>N: CALL db.index.vector.queryNodes('bcio_embedding_idx', $limit, $emb)<br/>YIELD node, score<br/>MATCH (c:Context)-[:MAPS_TO]->(node)<br/>MATCH (h:Habit)-[:HAS_CONTEXT]->(c)<br/>WHERE h.userID <> $exclude_user_id AND h.is_habit = true<br/>RETURN h.uuid, sentence, collect(ctx), h.annotations_like, score
            end
            N-->>AI: top-k per index; merge by max(score) per UUID → COMMUNITY_HABITS_LIMIT (default 10)
            Note over AI: dedup personal + community by UUID → candidate pool ≤ 20 habits
            AI->>LLM: extract_habits.txt (temp 0.0)<br/>vars: {goal}, {habits_json}
            LLM-->>AI: {selected_habit_uuids, habit_summary}

        and Annotated habits (MongoDB + Neo4j)
            AI->>M: db.habit_annotations.find({userId, type:{$in:["helpful","iDoThis","like"]}}, {habitId:1, _id:0})
            M-->>AI: habit UUIDs this user liked/saved
            AI->>N: MATCH (h:Habit {is_habit:true}) WHERE h.uuid IN $uuids<br/>OPTIONAL MATCH (h)-[:HAS_CONTEXT]->(c:Context)<br/>RETURN h.uuid, coalesce(h.translationEN, h.sentence), collect(c), h.annotations_like
            N-->>AI: annotated habit nodes with context

        and M3.2 — extract-profile (3 parallel HTTP calls, X-Service-Auth-Token)
            AI->>MB: GET /api/v1/questionnaire-responses/service/{userId}/sliq
            MB-->>AI: SLIQ answers JSON (or 404 → empty)
            AI->>MB: GET /api/v1/questionnaire-responses/service/{userId}/rand-36
            MB-->>AI: RAND-36 answers JSON (or 404 → empty)
            AI->>MB: GET /api/v1/user-profile/service/{userId}
            MB-->>AI: profile fields (age, gender, ...)
            AI->>LLM: extract_profile.txt (temp 0.0)<br/>vars: {goal}, {profile_json}, {sliq_json}, {rand36_json}
            LLM-->>AI: {profile_summary, profile_detailed, rag_query}
        end

        Note over AI: rag_query from M3.2 (or fallback to raw goal)
        AI->>LR: POST /query<br/>{query: rag_query, mode: "hybrid", only_need_context: true}<br/>timeout: 90 s
        LR-->>AI: synthesised context string (graph + vector over KB documents)

        AI->>M: db.recommendation_feedback.find({userId, goal}, {comment:1, _id:0})<br/>  .sort({created_at: -1}).limit(10)
        M-->>AI: prior feedback comments (or empty)

        Note over AI,LLM: recommend.txt (temp 0.2) assembles all 9 variables:<br/>{goal} {profile_summary} {profile_detailed} {habit_summary}<br/>{habits_json} {annotated_habits_json} {community_habits_json} {sources_json} {prior_feedback}
        AI->>LLM: POST /chat/completions (recommend.txt prompt, temp 0.2)
        LLM-->>AI: {recommendations: [{title, body, rationale}]}

        AI->>M: db.recommendations.insertOne({recommendation_id, userId, goal, session_id, recommendations, generated_at})
        AI->>R: SETEX recommend:{sha256} 86400 <RecommendResponse JSON>
    end

    AI-->>B: {recommendation_id, recommendations, generated_at}
    B-->>F: 200 OK
    F->>F: Render recommendation cards
